    {
      "sentence": 2,
      "chunk": 4,
      "source_English": "whose pipe stretched some 50 metres to the Pacific.",
      "text": "（whose pipe…：非限制性定语从句，whose pipe = the drain's pipe）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 3,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Staff reconstructed that route from the slime residue it deposited.",
      "text": "reconstructed：（使重现）",
      "kind": "current inline word gloss"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 4,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "when a fisherman retrieved it from a crayfish pot off Napier.",
      "text": "crayfish pot：（专门捕虾的笼子）",
      "kind": "current inline word gloss"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 4,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "when a fisherman retrieved it from a crayfish pot off Napier.",
      "text": "（since 2014, when…：when 引出非限制性定语从句，说明2014年发生的事）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 5,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "The breakout went unreported for about three months.",
      "text": "（go + 形容词：处于某种状态；go unreported：没有被报道）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 6,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Made public in April 2016, the story travelled the globe.",
      "text": "（Made public…：过去分词短语作状语，= After it was made public…）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 7,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Such agility stems from an octopus's pliable body,",
      "text": "agility：（动作敏捷）",
      "kind": "current inline word gloss"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 8,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "so any crevice that accommodates the beak will do.",
      "text": "（will do：行得通，够用）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 9,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "which handle sensory input",
      "text": "（指通过感官器官接收到的外部刺激或信息，包括视觉、听觉、触觉、味觉和嗅觉等）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 11,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "needing 15 minutes at the outset, later about two.",
      "text": "（needing…：分词短语作伴随状语；later about two 省略了 needing … minutes）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 12,
      "chunk": 3,
      "source_English": "adopting a different hue and posture for each.",
      "text": "（adopting…：分词短语作伴随状语，说明章鱼区分两人时的表现）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 13,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "among animals possessing the neurological substrates for conscious awareness.",
      "text": "（possessing…：现在分词短语作后置定语，修饰 animals）"
